# the app needs no environment variables.
# onze never holds an anthropic key on the server: users add their own key
# in the browser, which calls anthropic directly.
#
# developers only: npm run eval:live (scripts/eval/llm/live.ts) reads this
# from your shell to generate claude replies for the golden set. it costs
# money, asks before calling, and is never read by api/, web/ or lib/ (lint
# enforces it). never set it in vercel.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
